## OCR Extraction

Extract:

- Medicine Name
- Strength
- Dosage
- Expiration Date
- Batch Number

Examples:

"Dafalgan 500mg"

"Paracetamol 1g"

"EXP 04/2028"

Store confidence score.

---

## Inventory

User can:

- Add medicines
- Edit medicines
- Remove medicines
- Search medicines
- Filter medicines

---

## Expiration Monitoring

Detect:

- Expired
- Expiring in 90 days
- Expiring in 30 days
- Expiring in 7 days

Generate local notifications.

---

## Export

Allow export to:

- PDF
- CSV
- JSON

