# CLEAN ARCHITECTURE

Always maintain:

```text
lib/

core/
application/
domain/
infrastructure/
presentation/

features/
```

Business logic must remain independent of Flutter.

UI must never contain business logic.

Database code must never be called directly from widgets.

Use dependency inversion.

Follow SOLID principles.

---

# FEATURE-FIRST ORGANIZATION

Structure code by feature:

```text
features/

inventory/
scanning/
notifications/
settings/
authentication/
```

Avoid giant shared folders.

Prefer local feature ownership.

